   "source": [
    "**Observation:** All of the columns with >= 50% of data missing belong to the same thematic subset - 'building_stats' - except for for 'OWN_CAR_AGE' and 'EXT_SOURCE_1'. \n",
    "\n",
    "'OCCUPATION_TYPE', 'DAYS_EMPLOYED' and 'EXT_SOURCE_3' are also noteworthy as they come from categoreis that would typically be key criteria when assessing an application for a mortgage.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Decision:** The 'building_stats' subset require a separate assessment of its missingness for a better understanding of its relevance for predicting default. The other two columns with high missingness percentage (>=50%) require a more granualr assessment when looking at their correlation with default."
   ]
  },
