    "# Check whetehr missingness of Car Ages for each borrower corresponds with them owning a car or not\n",
    "\n",
    "car_age_missing = df['OWN_CAR_AGE'].isnull()\n",
    "\n",
    "(df.loc[car_age_missing, 'FLAG_OWN_CAR'] =='N').mean().round(4)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a967309e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Observation/Decision:** almost a complete match of hte missingness for 'OWN_CAR_AGE' to borrowers that do not own a car. Therefore this is MAR missingness and requires no action at this stage."
   ]
  },
  {
